  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Scope \u2014 Policy Ops",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Policy Ops** fuses the cluster's enforcement layers into one window: **Cilium network policy** (Hubble verdicts / drops), **CrowdSec IPS/AppSec**, **admission control** (Kyverno), and **TLS/cert policy** (cert-manager + Traefik). Complements *network-ops* (traffic), *crowdsec-ops* (IPS detail) and the security overview.\n\n> **Posture: mostly allow-all.** Only **6 CiliumNetworkPolicies** exist, in **2 namespaces** (`honeypot`, `iocaine`); 0 cluster-wide policies. Grounded: ~**35** endpoints run under default-deny vs ~**1767** allow-all endpoints (`cilium_policy_endpoint_enforcement_status`). Everything outside honeypot/iocaine is unrestricted L3/L4.",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      }
    },
